OL,3,AChina's growth accelerates as AI export
OL,4,Aboom outweighs domestic weakness
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina's economic growth picked up in
OL,7,Fthe three months to the end of
OL,8,FSeptember, rebounding from a three-year
OL,9,Flow as the artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,10,Fboom helped boost exports.
OL,12,FThe world's second largest economy grew
OL,13,Fby 4.5% in the third quarter, up from
OL,14,F4.3% in the previous period but below
OL,15,Fthe 5% expansion recorded from January
OL,16,Fto March, according to official Chinese
OL,17,Fdata.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
