OL,3,AChina's growth accelerates as AI export
OL,4,Aboom outweighs domestic weakness
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest figure is at the bottom end
OL,7,Fof Beijing's annual growth target of
OL,8,F4.5%-5%, which analysts have said gives
OL,9,Fpolicymakers room to address the
OL,10,Fcountry's economic challenges.
OL,12,FExports have helped offset weak
OL,13,Fspending at home, but global trade
OL,14,Ftensions and uncertainty over AI
OL,15,Finvestments are clouding its outlook.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
